    <item>
      <title>[forge-1.20.1] 2.创作模式物品栏</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F/minecraft/forge-1.20.1/2/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F/minecraft/forge-1.20.1/2/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[forge-1.20.1] 2.创作模式物品栏</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="创作模式物品栏creativemodetab">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%88%9b%e4%bd%9c%e6%a8%a1%e5%bc%8f%e7%89%a9%e5%93%81%e6%a0%8fcreativemodetab"></a>
创作模式物品栏[CreativeModeTab]
</h1><h2 id="combyzhdiverse_drawitemmodcreativemodetabs">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#combyzhdiverse_drawitemmodcreativemodetabs"></a>
com/byzh/diverse_draw/item/ModCreativeModeTabs
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">com.byzh.diverse_draw.item</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">com.byzh.diverse_draw.DiverseDraw</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.core.registries.Registries</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.network.chat.Component</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.CreativeModeTab</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.CreativeModeTabs</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.Items</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraftforge.eventbus.api.IEventBus</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraftforge.registries.DeferredRegister</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraftforge.registries.RegistryObject</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">ModCreativeModeTabs</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="c1">// 延迟注册器</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">final</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">DeferredRegister</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">CreativeModeTab</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">CREATIVE_MODE_TABS</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="n">DeferredRegister</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">create</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Registries</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">CREATIVE_MODE_TAB</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">DiverseDraw</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">MODID</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="c1">// 使用`延迟注册器`注册一个对象</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">final</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">RegistryObject</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">CreativeModeTab</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Diverse_Draw_TAB</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="n">CREATIVE_MODE_TABS</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">register</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;diverse_draw&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">CreativeModeTab</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">builder</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">icon</span><span class="p">(()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">ItemStack</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Moditems</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">ICE_ETHER</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">get</span><span class="p">()))</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">title</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Component</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">translatable</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;itemGroup.diverse_draw&#34;</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// 翻译的键</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">displayItems</span><span class="p">((</span><span class="n">pParameters</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">pOutput</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                        </span><span class="n">pOutput</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">accept</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Moditems</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">ICE_ETHER</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">get</span><span class="p">());</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                        </span><span class="n">pOutput</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">accept</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Moditems</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">RAW_ICE_ETHER</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">get</span><span class="p">());</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">})</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="c1">// 使用`延迟注册器`注册一个对象</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">final</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">RegistryObject</span><span class="o">&lt;</span><span class="n">CreativeModeTab</span><span class="o">&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">MATERIAL_TABS</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="n">CREATIVE_MODE_TABS</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">register</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;material&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">CreativeModeTab</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">builder</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">icon</span><span class="p">(()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">ItemStack</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Moditems</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">CARDBOARD</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">get</span><span class="p">()))</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">title</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Component</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">translatable</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;itemGroup.material&#34;</span><span class="p">))</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// 翻译的键</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">displayItems</span><span class="p">((</span><span class="n">pParameters</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">pOutput</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                        </span><span class="n">pOutput</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">accept</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Moditems</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">CARDBOARD</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">get</span><span class="p">());</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                        </span><span class="n">pOutput</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">accept</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Items</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">DIAMOND</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// 其实也可以加原版的这些东西</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">})</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">withTabsBefore</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Diverse_Draw_TAB</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">getKey</span><span class="p">())</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// 用于调整前后显示位置</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">                    </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">void</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">register</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">IEventBus</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">eventBus</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="n">CREATIVE_MODE_TABS</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">register</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">eventBus</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>物品的各种属性都存在 <code>ItemStack</code> 这个容器里, 物品的 <code>Item</code> 本身不存这些</li>
<li>Component.translatable 会去查看 lang 里面的具体内容</li>
<li><code>Items.DIAMOND</code> 是原版的物品, 本身就是 <code>Item</code> 类型
-&gt; 符合 pOutput.accept 的输入类型, 不需要 <code>.get()</code></li>
<li><code>Moditems.CARDBOARD</code> 是自己创建的物品, 是 <code>RegistryObject&lt;Item&gt;</code> 类型
-&gt; 不符合 pOutput.accept 的输入类型, 需要 <code>.get()</code> 获得其内的 <code>Item</code> 类型</li>
</ul>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-08-29首发于<a href='https://byzhrichard.github.io/'>byzh的博客</a>，最后修改于2026-08-29</p>]]>
      </description>
      
        <category>forge-1.20.1</category>
      
    </item>
    
    

